{"ID":"20240206085649-6gs9rzw","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206085649-6gs9rzw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206085649-6gs9rzw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206085658-dhwdsxo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613104402-xo5k657\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3000,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240701115525-mvs8lur\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"297狼毒（野狼毒）","type":"doc","updated":"20240823165048"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206085658-dhwdsxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085658-dhwdsxo","updated":"20240206085701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河北、内蒙古、西北、东北等地。\n【性状】\t根呈膨大的纺锤形或呈圆锥形至长圆柱形，稍扭曲，长730cm，直径27cm；根头部留有地上茎残基；外表棕色至棕褐色，有纵皱及横生的细长皮孔，有时残留细根。栓皮剥落后，露出柔软的白色纤维。体轻，质韧，不易折断，断面中心木质部黄白色，外圈韧皮部白色，呈纤维状。气微，味微甘、微苦而辣。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，平，有毒。\n【功效】\t泻水逐饮；破积杀虫。水肿腹胀；痰食虫积；心腹疼痛；症瘕积聚；结核；疥癣。"}]},{"ID":"20240206085653-g3l6ykp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085653-g3l6ykp","updated":"20240206085653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206085653-o0iia3f.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823164602-z0q9r7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823164602-z0q9r7q","updated":"20240823164701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 420px;","style":"width: 410px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒5-20240701115128-svjxl69.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 410px;\" parent-style=\"width: 420px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 856px;","style":"width: 846px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒6-20240701115419-jp8f2gc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 846px;\" parent-style=\"width: 856px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823164749-5g5nr0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823164749-5g5nr0x","updated":"20240823164749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒 2-20240823164749-7ouxcg7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 597px;","style":"width: 587px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒7-20240701115525-j3gqo6o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 587px;\" parent-style=\"width: 597px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618131553-ckeml2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618131553-ckeml2p","updated":"20240823164833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 604px;","style":"width: 594px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒2-20240701114759-maf7clq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 594px;\" parent-style=\"width: 604px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 631px;","style":"width: 621px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒 3-20240823164833-1ozmsuq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 621px;\" parent-style=\"width: 631px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618131553-ll8i1dr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618131553-ll8i1dr","updated":"20240823164845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 660px;","style":"width: 650px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒4-20240701115041-9vgwga3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 650px;\" parent-style=\"width: 660px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 567px;","style":"width: 557px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒 1-20240823164638-0fa93b3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 557px;\" parent-style=\"width: 567px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823164924-xbcp9ev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823164924-xbcp9ev","updated":"20240823165048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 342px;","style":"width: 332px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒 4-20240823164924-nr4wzlc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 332px;\" parent-style=\"width: 342px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 412px;","style":"width: 402px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒 5-20240823165008-cbymtrk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 402px;\" parent-style=\"width: 412px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒 6-20240823165048-y88anrx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823164453-xx1i4t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823164453-xx1i4t9","updated":"20240823164850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 638px;","style":"width: 628px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒-20240823164545-jn02tth.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 628px;\" parent-style=\"width: 638px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 569px;","style":"width: 559px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"狼毒8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/狼毒8-20240701115627-ge3vs1e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 559px;\" parent-style=\"width: 569px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240613104407-vj16s8m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104407-vj16s8m"}},{"ID":"20240613104612-72smjy2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104612-72smjy2","updated":"20240613104617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狼毒《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104612-en2glpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104612-en2glpp","updated":"20240613104612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛平。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104612-o54jv5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104612-o54jv5s","updated":"20240613104612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主咳逆上气，破积聚饮食，寒热，水气恶创，鼠瘘，疽蚀，鬼精，蛊毒，杀飞鸟走兽。一名续毒。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104612-gr0r0eh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104612-gr0r0eh","updated":"20240613104612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生秦亭及奉高，二月八月，采根阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104612-9kq2xg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104612-9kq2xg4","updated":"20240613104612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：狼毒也，疑上脱续毒二字。《中山经》云：大騩之山有草焉，其状如蓍而毛，青华而白实，其名曰，服之不夭，可以不腹病。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104407-ff71ycx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104407-ff71ycx"}},{"ID":"20240613104600-x585huf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-x585huf","updated":"20240613104606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狼毒《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-w5jar6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-w5jar6j","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（根）辛、平、有大毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-3pcczz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-3pcczz2","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-zty4991","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-zty4991","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、心腹痛。用狼毒二两、附子半两，捣烂，加蜜成丸，如梧子大。第一天服一丸，第二天服二丸，第三天服三丸，然后又加一丸起至三丸止，如此循环直以病愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-3hew7lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-3hew7lg","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、腹中冷痛（民证停痰，两胁痞满）。用狼毒三两、附子一两、旋复花三两，共捣为末，加蜜做成丸，如梧子大。每服三丸，饭前服。白开水送下。每天服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-z7rvh1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-z7rvh1m","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、阴疝（睾丸缩入腹中，急痛）。用狼毒四两、防风二两、附子三两，共研为末，加蜜做成丸子，如梧子大。每服三丸，日夜连服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-bcbwy1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-bcbwy1z","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、寄生虫病。用狼毒研细，取一钱，加糖一块，临醒时空腹服，水送下。次早即有虫排出。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-hpikzup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-hpikzup","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、干湿虫疥。用狼毒（不拘多少）捣烂，以猪油、马油调搽患处。睡时勿以被蒙头，恐药气伤脸。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-dl3x4ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-dl3x4ne","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、积年疥癞。用狼毒一两，一半生研、一半炒研，加轻粉三合、水银三钱，共为末，浸清油中三日（油中加茶末少许），蘸油涂患处。同时以口鼻在药碗上吸气以助药效。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-js7jrvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-js7jrvu","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、积年干癣（抓破则出黄水，每逢阴雨即痒）。用狼毒末涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104600-rxu7v8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104600-rxu7v8l","updated":"20240613104600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、恶疾风疮。用狼毒、秦艽，等分为末，每服一匙，温酒送下，一天服一至二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104710-l54a284","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104710-l54a284"}},{"ID":"20240613104711-txzss4l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104711-txzss4l","updated":"20240613104715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野狼毒《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104711-562z6gw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104711-562z6gw","updated":"20240613104747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，平，有大毒。主咳逆上气，破积聚饮食，寒热水气，胁下积癖，恶疮鼠鬼精蛊毒。杀飞鸟走兽。一名续毒。生擒亭山谷及奉高，二月八月采根阴干。陈而沉水者良。（大豆为之使，恶麦句姜。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104824-wzktcrh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104824-wzktcrh"}},{"ID":"20240613104825-pydcsie","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104825-pydcsie","updated":"20240613104838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野狼毒《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104825-e6os0lp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104825-e6os0lp","updated":"20240613104833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"野狼毒"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生秦亭山谷及奉高，今陕西州郡及辽、石州亦有之。苗叶似商陆及大黄，茎叶上有毛；四月开花，八月结实；根皮黄，肉白。二月、八月采根，阴干。以陈而沉水者良。葛洪治心腹相连常胀痛者。用野狼毒二两，附子半两，捣筛，蜜丸如桐子大。一日服一丸，二日二丸，三日三丸。再一丸，至六日，又三丸；自一至三常服，即瘥。《千金》疗恶疾，以野狼毒，秦艽分两等，捣末，酒服方寸匕，日二常服之，瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104847-a9os8j2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104847-a9os8j2"}},{"ID":"20240613104848-sivdny2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104848-sivdny2","updated":"20240613104901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野狼毒《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104848-9dq92r0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104848-9dq92r0","updated":"20240613104848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大豆为之使。恶麦句姜。畏醋、占斯、密陀僧。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104848-0l1avg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104848-0l1avg6","updated":"20240613104848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦、辛、平。有大毒。入手太阴，兼少阴经气分。治咳逆上气，除胸下积癖，及痰饮症瘕，去恶疮鼠 。配秦艽，治恶疾风疮。配附子，治心腹连痛。醋炒用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104918-lw8iikm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104918-lw8iikm"}},{"ID":"20240613104919-x1stzno","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104919-x1stzno","updated":"20240613104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野狼毒《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104919-co0cmd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104919-co0cmd5","updated":"20240613104919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、平、有大毒。主咳逆上气，破积聚饮食，寒热水气，胁下积癖，恶疮，鼠 ，疽蚀兽。一名续毒。生秦亭山谷及奉高。二月、八月采根，阴干。陈而沉水者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104919-oovn19k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104919-oovn19k","updated":"20240613104919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大豆为之使，恶麦句姜。秦亭在陇西，亦出宕昌。乃言止有数亩地生，蝮蛇食其根，故为难得。亦用太山者，今用出汉中及建平。云与防葵同根类，但置水中沉者，便是野狼毒，浮者则是防葵。俗用希，亦难得，是疗腹内要药尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104919-bvioari","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104919-bvioari","updated":"20240613104919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕"}]},{"ID":"20240613104919-bdrquox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104919-bdrquox","updated":"20240613104919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此物与防葵，都不同类，生处又别。野狼毒今出秦州、成州，秦亭故在二州之界，其太山、汉中亦不闻有。且秦陇寒地，元无腹蛇，复云数亩地生，蝮蛇食其根，谬矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104907-7b7nryy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104907-7b7nryy"}},{"ID":"20240613104908-o0chp1c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104908-o0chp1c","updated":"20240613104912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野狼毒《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104908-asfimyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104908-asfimyr","updated":"20240613104908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛平。主咳逆上气。破积聚饮食。寒热。水气。恶创。鼠。疽蚀。鬼精。蛊毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104908-xafxovp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104908-xafxovp","updated":"20240613104908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"杀飞虫走兽。一名续毒。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104908-xouhd3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104908-xouhd3r","updated":"20240613104908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六陈举一。九种心平。衡量重实。芟夷浮轻。饮昏食餮。兽怪禽惊。防葵滥厕。茹缠萦。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104908-03nwp44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104908-03nwp44","updated":"20240613104908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"马志曰。此与麻黄橘皮半夏枳实吴茱萸为六陈也。孟子举一而废百也。和剂局方。治九种心痛。一虫。二蛀。三风。四悸。五食。六饮。七冷。八热。九气。名医曰。陈而沉水者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104908-avme41m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104908-avme41m","updated":"20240613104908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"韩保升曰。根轻浮者劣。王续诗。此日长昏饮。玉篇。餮。贪食也。唐太宗诗。怖兽潜幽壑。惊禽散碧空。苏颂曰。今人用枯朽野狼毒当防葵。大误。李时珍曰。茹如续随子之状。或以其根。为野狼毒者非是。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104811-m7b7rub","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104811-m7b7rub"}},{"ID":"20240613104812-nlde4gj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104812-nlde4gj","updated":"20240613104817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野狼毒《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104812-nfj6hat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104812-nfj6hat","updated":"20240613104812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，平，有大毒。主咳逆上气，破积聚饮食，寒热水气，胁下积癖，恶疮鼠 疽蚀，鬼精蛊毒，杀飞鸟走兽。一名续毒。生秦亭山谷及奉高。二月、八月采根，阴干。陈而沉水者良。（大豆为之使，恶麦名姜。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104812-nkf1flu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104812-nkf1flu","updated":"20240613104812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶秦亭在陇西，亦出宕昌。乃言只有数亩地生，蝮蛇食其根，故为难得。亦用泰山者，今用出汉中及建平。云与防葵同根类，但置水中沉者便是野狼毒，浮者则是防葵。俗用稀亦难得，是疗腹内要药尔。唐本注云∶此物与防葵都不同类，生处又别。野狼毒今出秦州、成州，秦亭故在二州之界，其泰山、汉中亦不闻有。且秦陇寒地，原无复蛇。复云数亩地生，蝮蛇食其根，谬矣。今按别本注云∶与麻黄、橘皮、吴茱萸、半夏、枳实为六陈也。又按野狼毒，叶似商陆及大黄，茎、叶上有毛，根皮黄，肉白。以实重者为良，轻者力劣。秦亭在陇西，奉高乃泰山下县。亦出宕昌及汉中，建平。旧经陶云∶与防葵同根，以置水中，浮者即是防葵，沉者即是野狼毒，此不足为信。假使防葵秋冬采者坚实，得水皆沉。野狼毒春夏采者轻虚，得水乃浮尔。按此与防葵全别，生处不同，故不可将为比类。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶根似玄参，浮虚者为劣也。药性论云∶野狼毒，使，味苦、辛，有毒。治痰饮症瘕，亦杀鼠。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104812-gcuutpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104812-gcuutpc","updated":"20240613104812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶野狼毒，生秦亭山谷及奉高，今陕西州郡及辽、石州亦有之。苗叶似商陆及大黄，茎叶上有毛，四月开花，八月结实，根皮黄，肉白。二月、八月采，阴干。以陈而沉水者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104812-e2ihk5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104812-e2ihk5y","updated":"20240613104812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛洪治心腹相连常胀痛者。用野狼毒二两，附子半两，捣筛蜜丸如桐子大。一日服一丸，二日二丸，三日三丸，再一丸，至六日又三丸，自一至三常服即瘥。《千金》疗恶疾。以野狼毒、秦艽分两等，捣末酒服方寸匕，日二，常服之瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104812-qwkqw26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104812-qwkqw26","updated":"20240613104812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"圣惠方∶治干癣，积年生痂，搔之黄水出，每逢阴雨即痒。用野狼毒末涂之。集效方∶治脏腑内一切虫病。川野狼毒杵末，每服一大钱，用饧一皂子大，沙糖少许，以水同化，临卧空腹服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104812-ftgei20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104812-ftgei20","updated":"20240613104812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服时先吃微紧，食药一服，来日早取下虫，效。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104624-0smne4u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104624-0smne4u"}},{"ID":"20240613104626-uhu41pl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104626-uhu41pl","updated":"20240613104630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野狼毒《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104626-05dghuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104626-05dghuh","updated":"20240613104626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，平，有大毒。主治咳逆上气，破积聚饮食，寒热水气，胁下积癖，恶疮，鼠 ，疽蚀，鬼精，蛊毒，杀飞鸟走兽。一名续毒。生秦亭山谷及奉高。二月、八月采根，阴干，陈而沉水者良。（大豆为之使，恶麦句姜。）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104626-p1dc0nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104626-p1dc0nn","updated":"20240613104626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦亭在陇西，亦出宕昌。乃言只有数亩地生，蝮蛇食其根，故为难得。亦用太山者，今用出汉中及建平。云与防葵同根类，但置水中沉者，便是野狼毒，浮者则是防葵。世用稀，亦难得，是治腹内要药尔。（《大观》卷十一，《政和》二六八页）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104651-k8a4296","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104651-k8a4296"}},{"ID":"20240613104652-t2q55rn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104652-t2q55rn","updated":"20240613104659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野狼毒《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104652-yo1ikyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104652-yo1ikyz","updated":"20240613104652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛寒，大毒。陈者良，醋炒用。出东鲁泰山，与防葵相类。置水沉者为野狼毒，浮者即防葵也。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104652-bwnyixk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104652-bwnyixk","updated":"20240613104652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主咳逆上气，破积聚饮食，寒热水气，恶疮鼠 ，疽蚀，鬼精蛊毒，杀飞鸟走兽。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104652-il3qz1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104652-il3qz1k","updated":"20240613104652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"野狼毒大毒。非恒用之品。《本经》治咳逆上气，惟质实气壮暴咳者宜之。又能破积聚饮食，寒热水气，以其迅利也。性能杀飞鸟走兽，其治恶疮疽蚀蛊毒，所不待言。《肘后方》以野狼毒二两、附子半两，治心腹连痛胀急。加旋复蜜丸，日服三丸，治腹中冷痛及两胁气结，又为散擦恶疮疥癣。愚按∶野狼毒与防葵同根，但质有轻重之别，虽《本经》主治不同，一皆瞑眩之品，功用亦不甚相远。今野狼毒内有轻浮者，即系防葵无疑，但《本经》条下有坚骨髓，益气轻身之说。其性善走散，力能攻逐三虫，故有益气轻身之功。《本经》不言攻虫而攻蛊之用，与野狼毒无异。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104349-zifloaq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104349-zifloaq"}},{"ID":"20240613104359-ww203mr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ww203mr","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：狼毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-qi6lp6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-qi6lp6e","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-xj6dsp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-xj6dsp0","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lánɡ Dú"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-nfofixv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-nfofixv","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-gfjy7j1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-gfjy7j1","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 红狼毒、绵大戟、一把香、山萝卜、红火柴头花、断肠草[河北围场]"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-t9odfdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-t9odfdt","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ylpcts7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ylpcts7","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 瑞香科狼毒属植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"瑞香狼毒"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Stellera chamaejasme L.的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季采挖，洗净，切片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-6yi8rfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-6yi8rfc","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-atlj2e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-atlj2e3","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛、苦，平。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-bgdcort","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-bgdcort","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-9nm4y7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-9nm4y7g","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 散结，逐水，止痛，杀虫。用于水气肿胀，淋巴结结核；外用治疥、癣，杀蝇、蛆。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-wnghamr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-wnghamr","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-r7wkslg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-r7wkslg","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 3～8分；外用适量，煎水洗或研粉敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-z2ogpsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-z2ogpsf","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-kqz1u0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-kqz1u0t","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）有大毒，中毒则腹痛、腹泻，里急后重，孕妇可致流产。冲捣时需戴口罩，否则易引起过敏性皮炎等。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-mzotprt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-mzotprt","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ioqj2rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ioqj2rh","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-5a8f1zq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-5a8f1zq","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：狼毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-gwtrfo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-gwtrfo6","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-er1hhbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-er1hhbu","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lánɡ Dú"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-2clda4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-2clda4p","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-wx6sj2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-wx6sj2f","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 续毒（《本经》），川狼毒（《集效方》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-0oofdka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-0oofdka","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-slmeg8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-slmeg8s","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ey8c7wb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ey8c7wb","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-5anunam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-5anunam","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为瑞香科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"瑞香狼毒"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或大戟科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"狼毒大戟"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"月腺大戟"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春、秋采挖，去茎叶、泥沙，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-v2w4p6y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-v2w4p6y","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-zfbscnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-zfbscnb","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①瑞香狼毒，又名：断肠草、打碗花、山丹花、闷头花、一把香。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-j0m1xnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-j0m1xnj","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生草本，高20～40厘米。根圆柱形。茎丛生，平滑无毛，下部几木质，带褐色或谈红色。单叶互生，较密；狭卵形至线形，长1～3厘米，宽2～10毫米，全缘，两面无毛；老时略带革质；叶柄极短。头状花序顶生，直径约2.5厘米，花多数；萼常呈花冠状，白色或黄色，带紫红色，萼筒呈细管状，先端5裂，裂片平展，矩圆形至倒卵形；雄蕊10，成2列着生于喉部；子房上位，上部密被细毛，花柱短，柱头头状。果卵形，为花被管基部所包。种子1枚。花期5～6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-mywgr0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-mywgr0p","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于高山及草原。分布东北、华北、西北、西南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-2s8rqv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-2s8rqv4","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②狼毒大戟"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-hnt1ag3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-hnt1ag3","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生草本，高15～40厘米，全体含白色乳汁。根肉质肥大。茎下部叶鳞片状，膜质，淡褐色；中、上部叶3～5片轮生，无柄；叶片长圆形或长圆状卵形，长4～6.5厘米，宽1～3厘米。先端钝或急尖，基部圆。杯状聚伞花序顶生，排成复伞形；伞梗5枝，基部轮生叶状苞片5；每枝再分3枝，分枝处有3片三角卵形的苞叶，小枝先端具2片较小的苞叶及1～3个杯状聚伞花序；雄花多数和雌花1枚同生于杯形的总苞内，总苞先端5裂，腺体5个与裂片互生；雄花仅有雄蕊1；雌花仅有雌蕊1，子房扁圆形，花柱3，先端浅裂成2叉状柱头。蒴果扁球形，有3纵沟，褐色。花期5～6月。果期6～7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-tzfc0hl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-tzfc0hl","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于山坡及山野向阳处。分布东北及河北、内蒙古、山西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-eza8zjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-eza8zjj","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③月腺大戟"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-znz0wxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-znz0wxs","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生草本，高30～50厘米。叶互生；叶片狭椭圆形或椭圆状披针形，长4～8厘米，宽1.5～2厘米，先端圆，基部楔形。杯状聚伞花序，排成复伞形；伞梗5枝，基部具卵状披针形或三角状长卵形的叶状苞片4～5枚；每枝再分2枝，分枝处有三角卵形或广卵形苞叶2枚，小枝先端具2片较小的苞叶及1个杯状聚伞花序；雌雄花同生于萼状杯形的总苞内，总苞先端4浅裂，腺体4个。蒴果光滑无毛。花期5～6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-shz0kwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-shz0kwn","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于山坡或林下草丛中。分布几遍全国。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-d0d6v7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-d0d6v7v","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-mrihsnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-mrihsnz","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①狼毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-9brvsa5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-9brvsa5","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：绵大戟、山萝卜（《滇南本草》），大将军、红狼毒、西北狼毒。为瑞香狼毒的干燥根，呈圆锥形至长圆柱形，稍扭曲，长7～30厘米，直径2～7厘米；根头部留有地上茎残基；外表棕色至棕褐色，有纵皱及横生的细长皮孔，有时残留细根。栓皮剥落后，露出柔软的纤维。体轻，质韧，不易折断，断面中心木质部黄白色，外圈韧皮部白色，呈纤维状。气微，味微甘、微苦而辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-nog1awg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-nog1awg","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产内蒙古、山西、河南、青海、甘肃、陕西、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-do8jxtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-do8jxtr","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②白狼毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-pvfelbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-pvfelbn","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为狼毒大戟、月腺大戟的干燥根，都切成类圆形的块片。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-c7z0vt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-c7z0vt7","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狼毒大戟"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-sxlou5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-sxlou5p","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：猫眼花根、东北狼毒。直径约4～7厘米，厚0.5～3厘米，偶有厚达7厘米者。表面黄棕色或淡棕色。栓皮成重叠的薄片状，易剥落。切面不平坦，有暗棕色与黄白色相间的明显同心环，偶有环纹不显著者。质轻，易折断，断面粉性，水湿之有粘性，撕开时可见粘丝。气微，味甘，并有刺激性辣味。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-xmmvbnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-xmmvbnl","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产辽宁、吉林、黑龙江、内蒙古、河北。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-fliocgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-fliocgv","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月腺大戟的根性状与上种相似，唯切面的同心环纹颜色较浅，不如狼毒大戟根的明显。以水湿之不显粘性。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-l9utx1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-l9utx1c","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产河南、山东、江苏、安徽、湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-9zoc4ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-9zoc4ll","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》所载的狼毒，系瑞香科瑞香狼毒，故应以此为正品，但目前多数地区所用的狼毒，为大戟科的白狼毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-20nzri8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-20nzri8","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-pm5ih72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-pm5ih72","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 瑞香狼毒的根含甾醇、酚性成分、氨基酸、三萜类及有毒的高分子有机酸。可能还含蒽甙。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-drmuvw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-drmuvw4","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狼毒大戟根含树脂10.46％及1～2％硬性橡胶。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-y76u1t3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-y76u1t3","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-shptlyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-shptlyv","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 从瑞香狼毒根中提得一种狼毒甙，原称川狼毒素的抗菌物质，并称其毒性很低。狼毒煎剂灌胃6克（生药）/公斤，可提高小鼠痛阈20～50％（电击小鼠尾法及热板法）。叶、根中可能含有蒽甙，能增强小肠蠕动，可治疗便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-22v4eys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-22v4eys","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狼毒大戟的根可用以杀蛆，灭孑孓。20％的煎剂对麻醉犬的呼吸、血压及离体蛙心、肠管均无甚作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-8nk9an5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-8nk9an5","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-oyw9jek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-oyw9jek","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生狼毒：用水洗净，润透，切片晒干。醋狼毒：取狼毒片加醋拌匀，稍闷，待醋吸尽，置锅内用文火炒至微干，取出晒干。（每100斤狼毒片，用米醋20～30斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-hunvcsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-hunvcsh","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-x1vcqtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-x1vcqtx","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《得配本事》：\"入手太阴，兼少阴经气分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-j3yl26z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-j3yl26z","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-i9ne58m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-i9ne58m","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦辛，平，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-unv7ugv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-unv7ugv","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ph03suh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ph03suh","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"有大毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-9pog7pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-9pog7pq","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"味苦辛，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-urglmga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-urglmga","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经逢原》：\"苦辛，寒，大毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-2szs0zk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-2szs0zk","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-dlhmc15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-dlhmc15","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品有毒，内服宜慎；体弱及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-u4k5n88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-u4k5n88","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"大豆为之使。恶麦句姜。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-zv3fulh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-zv3fulh","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药对》：\"畏占斯、密陀僧。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-karikg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-karikg8","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"脾元不足，真气日乏者，不可妄施。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ra1xarw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ra1xarw","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《得配本草》：\"畏醋。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-aaowqhq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-aaowqhq","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《高原中草药治疗手册》：\"孕妇忌用，慢性胃肠溃疡慎用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ijqu6nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ijqu6nt","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-9ssc4tn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-9ssc4tn","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 逐水祛痰，破积杀虫。治水肿腹胀，痰、食、虫积，心腹疼痛，慢性气管炎，咳嗽，气喘，淋巴结、皮肤、骨、副睾等结核，疥癣，痔瘘。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-kw0cwcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-kw0cwcc","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主咳逆上气，破积聚，饮食，寒热，水气，恶疮，鼠瘘疽蚀，蛊毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-7umgh3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-7umgh3r","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗胁下积癖。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-cqwy1lm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-cqwy1lm","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"治痰饮，症瘕。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-kafhnhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-kafhnhz","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《滇南本草》：\"治胃中年深日久饮食结住，积久稠痰，状粘如胶。攻虫积，利水道，下气，消水肿，吐痰涎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-hj72vye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-hj72vye","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草通玄》：\"主咳逆，治虫疽，瘰疬，结痰，驱心痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-f5z6oiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-f5z6oiz","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《高原中草药治疗手册》：\"下气杀虫。治痰饮停留，骨膜发炎，结核顽疮，酒齄鼻。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-dhrj5dy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-dhrj5dy","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-x34bf92","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-x34bf92","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3～8分；或入丸、散。外用：磨汁涂或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ipct4bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ipct4bm","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-dexqcdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-dexqcdz","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治积聚，心腹胀如故者：狼毒四两（锉碎，醋拌炒干），附子三两（炮裂，去皮脐），防葵三两。上药捣罗为末，炼蜜和捣三、二百杵，丸如梧桐子大。每于食前，以粥饮下五丸，以利为度。（《圣惠方》狼毒丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-23f7550","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-23f7550","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治卒心腹症坚，两胁下有气结者：狼毒二两，旋覆花一两，附子二两（炮）。捣筛，蜜和丸如梧子大。服二丸，稍加至三丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-85t3cbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-85t3cbk","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治心腹相连胀痛：狼毒二两，附子半两。捣筛，蜜丸如梧子大。日一服一丸，二日二丸，三日后服三丸，再一九，至六日，服三丸，自一至三以常服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-lkyj2p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-lkyj2p3","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治阴疝，阴丸卒缩入腹，急痛欲死：狼毒四两，防风二两，附子三两（烧）。蜜丸如桐子大，服三丸，日夜三度。（②方以下出《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-h954587","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-h954587","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治水肿：绵大戟细末，每股五分，滚水服。忌盐一百日，乃泻去黄水，其肿自消，如泻不止，冷粥补之。（《滇南本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-uqhb8fw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-uqhb8fw","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治一切食积、痰积、虫积、气积、痞块疼痛，胸膈肚腹膨胀，饮食不消，面皮黄瘦，单腹胀：绵大戟为末，米糊为丸。如马豆子大，每服七丸，滚水送下，以利为度。（《滇南本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-1d1e2vr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-1d1e2vr","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治淋巴结结核：㈠未溃或已溃者：狼毒切片，用水煮烂，除渣取药液，加热浓缩成膏，洗净伤口，外敷。㈡已溃者拔脓毒：狼毒一斤，蛇蜕八分，花椒一两，松香五钱。将狼毒煎制成膏，其他药研成细末，撒入并搅拌均匀。外敷。㈢愈合淋巴结结核伤口：狼毒一两，蒲公英根一两。煎成膏外敷。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-palal9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-palal9a","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治睾丸结核：狼毒、核桃、白矾各等量。烧存性，共研细末。每日一次，每次一钱三分，开水送服。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ccvi20o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ccvi20o","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治疠风癞疮：狼毒，童便浸炒，研末。每早晚各服五分，温酒下。（《张三丰仙传方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-162itxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-162itxb","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治干癣积年生痂，搔之黄水出，每逢阴雨即痒；狼毒，醋磨涂之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-x60nxmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-x60nxmk","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治久年干疥干癣及一切癞疮：狼毒（微炒研细末），轻粉减半。和匀，干疥癣癞疮，搔破搽之；湿者干掺，数次效。（《永类钤方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-n6k77ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-n6k77ku","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治脏腑内一切虫病：川狼毒杵末，每服一大钱，用饧一皂子大，沙糖少许，以水同化，临卧空腹服之，来日早取下虫效。（《集效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-wctvmfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-wctvmfk","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治外伤出血：绵大戟研末撒于伤口。（《云南中草药选》）"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-93gg693","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-93gg693","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-h4qtatb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-h4qtatb","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗皮肤病"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-we2j9sd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-we2j9sd","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取月腺大戟洗净，剥去老皮，切碎，加水煎煮，直至用手一捻即成粉末为止；然后用纱布过滤，药液继续煎煮浓缩至一定粘度，冷后涂布患处，每日或隔日1次。或制成片剂，每片含生药0.18克，头5天临睡前内服1片，第6～10天早晚各1片，以后增至早、中、晚各1片，一疗程为20～30天，个别延长至35天，总剂量7～12克。曾用上述稠膏治牛皮癣30例，13例痊愈，16例好转，1例无效；用片剂治牛皮癣22例，基本痊愈2例，显着好转11例，好转7例，无效2例。稠膏亦用于治疗神经性皮炎及慢性湿疹15例，均有较好疗效，一般涂药3～10次即可见效。本品有毒，口服片剂有胃肠道紊乱（如胃纳减退、恶心，肠鸣，腹泻、腹痛等），头昏痛，乏力，体重减轻等反应，除1例因腹泻次数较多而终止治疗外，其余病例暂停服药或减少剂量，均自行好转。另外发现部分病人治疗后白细胞及血小板数略有下降，应用维生素B4或B6后均恢复正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-5xo72p0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-5xo72p0","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗结核病"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-heei0lo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-heei0lo","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先制成狼毒枣，其法取狼毒放入锅内，加水煎煮，把大枣放入笼屉，约蒸二小时半即成；狼毒与大枣按2：4配制。成人每日3次，开始服狼毒枣每次10粒，视副作用有无，逐渐递增或减少，每次最多20粒；或第一周每日130克（约30粒），第二周每日225克（约45粒），第3周以后每日300克（约60粒）分三次食后内服，连服三个月为一疗程；间隔1～2周，视情况可再给第二疗程。曾治疗淋巴结结核、骨结核、皮肤结核、副睾结核、结核性角膜炎及肺结核，均有一定疗效。30例肺结核服后症状改善者22例，体重增加2～23市斤者28例，病灶进步18例，痰菌转阴9例，血沉下降14例，恶化者仅1例；对其他肺外结核，凡能耐心服用者，均有不同疗效。副作用有恶心、头昏、便溏等。经减量或停药后即消失。此外，蒸狼毒枣所剩在锅内的狼毒液经过滤后，用文火浓缩成稀糊状泥膏，可作局部治疗剂，治疗皮肤结核、癣疥、各种瞒性皮炎、酒齄鼻、秃疮及各种顽固性溃疡等，均有一定效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-jnw1dkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-jnw1dkd","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗肿瘤"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-yxp7rhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-yxp7rhf","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取狼毒1钱放入200毫升水中煮后捞出，再打入鸡蛋2只煮熟后吃蛋喝汤。用于治疗胃癌、肝癌、肺癌、甲状腺乳头状腺癌等25例，治后症状减轻，少数病例可见肿瘤缩小。也可用狼毒与鸡血藤、苡米、半枝莲等制成复方狼毒注射液，每日1次，每次20～40毫升，加入5％葡萄糖液行静脉滴注；或制成复方狼毒片内服。治疗20例晚期胃癌，在术前用药可以缓解症状，为手术治疗创造条件；在术后用药，可以巩固疗效，稳定病情。用药后一般具有止痛、增进食欲等作用。常见副作用有恶心、呕吐、头晕、轻度腹泻，未发现对肝、肾及神经方面的毒性表现。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-oqvi5o5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-oqvi5o5","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疗慢性气管炎"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-z18p8a0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-z18p8a0","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取狼毒大戟制成煎剂或丸剂，每次剂量相当于干品0.5克，每日3次，饭后服。治疗299例，观察10天，显效52例（17.39％），好转170例（56.86％）；具有较好的平喘、化痰及镇咳、消炎作用，尤以平喘作用显著；多数服药后1、2夭自觉出气省劲，痰易咯出，5天后咳嗽次数和痰量减少，食欲明显增加。但副作用较大，病人服水剂30分钟后即出现胃不适，口腔咽部发麻，头昏恶心，或腹泻、腹痛，停药后3～24小时，可自行好转；丸剂均有腹泻症状，对久热伤津、咽干舌燥、声哑、呕吐、恶心者不宜用。用上述的狼毒枣也可治疗本病，每次服3～5个，每日3次，副作用较水剂或丸剂明显减少。对278例观察1个月，基本治愈21例，占7.6％，显效119例，占42.8％，仅个别有轻微口干，极个别有轻微肝功能改变。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-rr9bto7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-rr9bto7","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-em50kcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-em50kcp","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经逢原》：\"狼毒大毒，非恒用之品。《本经》主咳逆上气，惟质实气壮暴咳者宜之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-r3bgetz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-r3bgetz","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-bd8sg2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-bd8sg2v","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-4taqwxq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-4taqwxq","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：狼毒"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ogrmqg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ogrmqg1","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-b3dtpsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-b3dtpsx","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lánɡ Dú"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-7bpf543","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-7bpf543","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-egut8dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-egut8dk","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 续毒、绵大戟、山萝卜、闷花头、热加巴、一扫光、搜山虎、一把香、药罗卜、生扯拢、红火柴头花、断肠草、猴子根。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-u5ic69c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-u5ic69c","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-upyrivc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-upyrivc","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Root of Fischer Euphorbia, Chinese Stellera Root, Langdu Root"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-chjawto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-chjawto","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-j6p9b6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-j6p9b6w","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-dmf7zps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-dmf7zps","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-xo8pzc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-xo8pzc3","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为瑞香科植物瑞香狼毒的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-j6byqe7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-j6byqe7","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Stellera chamaejasme L.[Passerina chamaejasme Fisch.]"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-y3iidg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-y3iidg0","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季挖根，洗净，鲜用或切片晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-j5zevw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-j5zevw7","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-7t69zo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-7t69zo7","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于向阳山坡、草丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-r1vgeoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-r1vgeoh","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华北、西北、西南及西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-t8gx854","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-t8gx854","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-fankg1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-fankg1l","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 瑞香狠毒 多年生草本，高20-40cm。茎丛生，基部木质化；根粗壮，圆锥形，木质多纤维。单叶互生；无柄或几无柄；叶片椭圆状披针形，长2-4cm，宽2-8mm，先端渐尖，基部楔形，两面无毛，全缘。花两性；头状花序，多数聚生枝顶，具总苞；花萼花瓣状，黄色或白色，先端5裂，裂片倒卵形，长2-3mm，其上有紫红色网纹；萼筒圆柱状，长8-12mm，有明显纵脉纹；雄蕊10，2轮排列，着生于萼筒中部以上，花丝极短；子房上位，1室，上部密被细毛，花柱短，柱头球形。果实圆锥形，干燥，包藏于宿存萼筒基部。花期5-6月，果期6-8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-1yhxvzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-1yhxvzb","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-0m4ezqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-0m4ezqc","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 根呈膨大的纺锤形、圆锥形或长圆柱形，稍弯曲，有的有分枝。根头部有地上茎残迹，表面棕色至棕褐色，有扭曲的纵沟及横生隆起的皮孔和侧根痕，栓皮剥落处露出白色柔软纤维。体轻、质韧，不易折断，断面呈纤维状。皮部类白色，木部淡黄色。气微，味微辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-avxrfsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-avxrfsn","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 根横切面：木栓层由十数层黄棕色木栓细胞组成；皮层菲薄，由薄壁细胞组成，韧皮部射线细胞2-3列，皮层及韧皮部均有多数纤维束群；形成层明显，细胞作切向延长，约5-6层；木质部宽阔，导管呈放射状排列。皮层及韧皮部的薄壁细胞内多含有淀粉粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ijgifzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ijgifzc","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：黄白色。①木栓细胞黄棕色。②韧皮部薄壁细胞圆形或不规则形，有细胞间隙。③网状导管，偶见具缘纹孔导管，直径30-50μm。④纤维无色，宽7-15μm。⑤淀粉粒多为单位，类圆形，盔帽形，层纹不明显，脐点点状或裂缝状，直径3-15μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-s1nu914","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-s1nu914","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-q7i1p8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-q7i1p8v","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 根含二萜、黄酮、木脂素、香豆精类成分。二萜类：格尼迪木任（gnidimacrin），河朔荛花素（simplexin），瑞香狼毒任（stelleramacrin）A、B，18-去-（苯甲酰氧基）-28-脱氧格尼迪木任（pimeleafactor P2），12-乙酰氧基赫雷毒素（subtoxin A），赭雷毒素（huratoxin）。黄酮类：狼毒素（chamaejasmin）A、B、C，狼毒素、异狼毒素（isochamaejasmin），7-甲氧基狼毒素（7-methoxychamaejasmin），新狼毒素（neochamaejasmin）A、B，狼毒色酮（chamaechromone）及二氢山柰酚（dihydrokaempferol）。木脂体：鹅掌揪树脂酚B（lirioresinol B），松脂酚（pinoresinol）穗罗汉松脂酚（matairesinol）。挥发油：有27种成分，已确定12种，主要为3，7，17-三甲基十二碳-反-2，顺-6，10-三烯酸（3，7，17-trimethyl-trans-2，cis-6，10-dodecatrienol），10，13-十八碳二烯酸甲酯（methyl-10，13-oc-tadecadienoate），正十三烷（n-tridecane），正十二烷（n-dodecane），2，6-二甲基庚烷（2，6-dimethylheptane）及肉桂醇（cinnamic alcohol）等。狼毒还含茴芹香豆精（pimpinellin），异香柑内酯（isober-gapten），异茴芹香豆精（isopimpinellin），牛防风素（sphondin）及蔗糖（sucrose）。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-wkme9ct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-wkme9ct","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-xvx24e9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-xvx24e9","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.抗肿瘤：狼毒水提取物作用10-40g(生药)/kg、醇提取物2.5-20g/kg腹腔注射，连续10天，对小鼠肝癌、Lewis肺癌均有抑作用；水提取物10、20g(生药)/kg、醇提取物2.5、5.0g/kg静脉注射，连续6天，对小鼠肝癌也有抑制作用；水提取物69.5g(生药)/kg、醇提取物26.09g/kg灌胃，连续10天，对小鼠肝癌也有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-36qsh19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-36qsh19","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.毒性：狼毒水提取物及醇提取物腹腔注射对小鼠的半数致死量分别为275.9g(生药)/kg及171.96g(生药)/kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-uu7ioo3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-uu7ioo3","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-8mahhcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-8mahhcb","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生狠毒：用水洗净，润透，切片晒干。醋狠毒：取狠毒片加醋拌匀，稍闷，待醋吸尽，置锅内用文火炒至微干，取出晒干。(每100斤狠毒片，用米醋30-50斤)"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-xhptwdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-xhptwdx","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ezlit4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ezlit4b","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 取本品粗粉5g，加乙醇20ml，置水浴上回流1h。滤过，滤液浓缩至5ml供下述实验：（1）取供试液1ml，加镁粉少许，盐酸数滴，置水浴中加热数分钟，放置显品红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-zn86ft6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-zn86ft6","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取供试液1ml，置蒸发皿中蒸干，加硼酸的饱和丙酮溶液及10％枸橼酸丙酮试液各1ml，继续蒸干，置紫外光灯下观察，显黄色荧光。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-jrubpf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-jrubpf8","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取供试液1滴于滤纸上，喷1％三氯化铝乙醇液烤干，置紫外光灯下观察，显黄色荧光。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-fqbwgj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-fqbwgj9","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-1hhtjik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-1hhtjik","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-lsbagcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-lsbagcz","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-f5mjo2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-f5mjo2z","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；辛；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-fvjd4if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-fvjd4if","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-py368np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-py368np","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品有毒，内服宜慎；体弱及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-qrudity","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-qrudity","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经集注》：大豆为之使。恶麦句姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-vqpmefh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-vqpmefh","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《药对》：畏占斯、密陀僧。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-qab9lsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-qab9lsv","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草汇言》：脾元不足，真气日乏者，不可妄施。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-tm1mmwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-tm1mmwm","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《得配本草》：畏醋。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-jeliihb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-jeliihb","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《高原中草药治疗手册》：孕妇忌用，慢性胃肠溃疡慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-1hk4ia7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-1hk4ia7","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-40sphly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-40sphly","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 泻水逐饮；破积杀虫。主水肿腹胀；痰食虫积；心腹疼痛；症瘕积聚；结核；疥癣"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-mm31kjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-mm31kjo","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-1ugf93x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-1ugf93x","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤1-3g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，研末调敷；或醋磨汁涂；或取鲜根去皮捣烂敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-4qw5l5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-4qw5l5s","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-rbodfls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-rbodfls","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治积聚，心腹胀如鼓者，狼毒四两(锉碎，醋拌炒干)，附子三两(炮裂，去皮脐)，防葵三两。上药捣罗为末，炼蜜和捣三、二百杵，丸如梧桐子大。每于食前，以粥饮下五丸，以利为度。(《圣惠方》狼毒丸)②治卒心腹症坚，两胁下有气结者：狼毒二两，旋覆花一两，附子二两(炮)。捣筛，蜜和丸如梧子大。服二丸，稍加至三丸。③治心腹相连胀痛：狼毒二两，附子半两。捣筛，蜜丸如梧子大。日一服一丸，二日二丸，三日后服三丸，再一丸，至六日，服三丸，自一至三以常服。④治阴疝，阴丸卒缩入腹，急痛欲死：狼毒四两，防风二两，附子三两(烧)。蜜丸如桐子大，服三丸，日夜三度。(②方以下出《补缺肘后方》)⑤治水肿：绵大戟细末，每服五分，滚水服。忌盐一百日，乃泻去黄水，其肿自消，如泻不止，冷粥补之。(《滇南本觅》)⑥治一切食积、痰积、虫积、气积、痞块疼痛，胸膈肚腹膨胀，饮食不消，面皮黄瘦，单腹胀：绵大戟为末，米糊为丸。如马豆子大，每服七丸，滚水送下，以利为度。(《滇南本草》)⑦治淋巴结结核： 一、未溃或已溃者：狼毒切片，用水煮烂，除渣取药液，加热浓缩成膏，洗净伤口，外敷。二、己溃者拔脓毒：狼毒一斤，蛇蜕八分，花椒一两，松香五钱。将狼毒煎制成膏，其他药研成细末，撒入并搅拌均匀。外敷。三、愈合淋巴结结核伤口：狼毒一两，蒲公英根一两。煎成膏外敷。(内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》)⑧治睾丸结核：狼毒、核桃、白矾各等量。烧存性，共研细末。每日一次，每次一钱三分，开水送服。(内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》)⑨治病风癞疮：狼毒，童便浸炒，研末。每早晚各服五分，温酒下。(《张三丰仙传方》)⑩治干癣积年生痂，搔之黄水出，每逢阴雨即痒：狼毒，醋磨涂之。(《圣惠方》)11.治久年干疥干癣及一切癞疮：狼毒(微炒研细末)，轻粉减半。和匀，干疥癣癞疮，搔破搽之；湿者干掺，数次效(《永类铃方》)12.治脏腑内一切虫病：川狼毒杵末，每服一大钱，用饧一皂子大，沙糖少许，以水同化，临卧空腹服之，来日早取下虫效。(《集效方》)13.治外伤 出血：绵大戟研末撒于伤口。(名云南中草药选》)"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-fr7cqdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-fr7cqdq","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-hmc276m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-hmc276m","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.治疗皮肤病：取月腺大戟洗净,剥去老皮，切碎，加水煎煮，直至用手一捻即成粉末为止；然后用纱布过滤，药液继续煎煮浓缩至一定粘度，冷后涂布患处，每日或隔日1次。或制成片剂，每片含生药0.18g，头5天临睡前内服1片，第6-10天早晚各1片，以后增至旱、中、晚备1片，一疗程为20-30天，个别延长至35天，总剂量7-12g。曾用上述稠膏治牛皮癣30例，13例痊愈，16例好转， 1例无效；用片剂治牛皮癣22例，基本痊愈2例，显着好转11例，好转7例，无效2例。稠膏亦用于治疗神经性皮炎及慢性湿疹15例，均有较好疗效，一般涂药3-10次即可见效。本品有毒，口服片剂有胃肠道紊乱(如胃纳减退、恶心、肠鸣、腹泻、腹痛等)，头昏痛，乏力，体重减轻等反应，除1例因腹泻次数较多而终止治疗外，其余病例暂停服药或减少剂量，均自行好转。另外发现部分病人治疗后白细胞及血小板数略有下降，应用维生素 B4或 B6后均恢复正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-anmxd97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-anmxd97","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.治疗结核病：先制成狼毒枣，其法取狼毒放入锅内，加水煎煮，把大枣放入笼屉，约蒸二小时半即成；狼毒与大枣按3：4配制。成人每日3次，开始服狼毒枣每次10粒，视副作用有无，逐渐递增或减少，每次最多20粒；或第一周每日130g(约30粒)，第二周每日225g(约45粒)，第3周以后每日300g(约60粒)分三次食后内服，连服三个月为一疗程；间隔1-2周，视情况可再 给第二疗程。曾治疗淋巴结结核、骨结核、皮肤结核、副睾结核、结核性角膜炎及肺结核，均有一定疗效。30例肺结核服后症状改善者22例，体重增加2-23市斤者28例，病灶进步18例，痰菌转阴9例，血沉下降14例，恶化者仅1例；对其他肺外结核，凡能耐心服用者，均有不同疗效。副作用有恶心、头昏、便溏等，经减量或停药后即消失。此外，蒸狼毒枣所剩在锅内的狼毒液经过滤后，用文火浓缩成稀糊状泥膏，可作局部治疗剂，治疗皮肤结核、癣疥、各种慢性皮炎、酒齄鼻、秃疮及各种顽固性溃疡等，均有一定效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-jfdig73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-jfdig73","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.治疗肿瘤：取狼毒 1钱放入200ml水中煮后捞出，再打人鸡蛋2只煮熟质吃蛋喝汤。用于治疗胃癌、肝癌、肺癌、甲状腺乳头状腺癌等25例，治后症状减轻，少数病例可见肿瘤缩小。也可用狼毒与鸡血藤、苡米、半枝莲等制成复方狠毒注射液，每日1次，每次20-40ml，加入5%葡萄糖液行静脉滴注；或制成复方狼毒片内服。治疗20例晚期胃癌，在术前用药可以缓解症状，为手术治疗创造条件；在末后用药，可以巩固疗效，稳定病情。用药后一般具有止痛、增进食欲等作用。常见副作用有恶心、呕吐、头晕、轻度腹泻，未发观对肝、肾及神经方面的毒性表现。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-e52sqeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-e52sqeh","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.治疗慢性气管炎：取狼毒大戟制成煎剂或丸剂，每次剂量相当于干品0.5g，每日3次，饭后服。治疗299例，观察10天，显效52例(17.39%)，好转170例(56.36%)；具有较好的平喘、化痰及镇咳、消炎作用，尤以平喘作用显着；多数服药后 l、2天自觉出气省劲，痰易咯出，5天后咳嗽次数和痰量减少，食欲明显增加。但副作用较大，病人服水剂30分钟后即出现胃不适，口腔咽部发麻,头昏恶心,或腹泻、腹痛，停药后3-24小时，可自行好转；丸剂均有腹泻症状，对久热伤津、咽干舌燥、声哑、呕吐、恶心者不宜用。用上述的狼毒枣也可治疗本病，每次服3-5个，每日3次，副作用较水剂或丸剂明显减少。对278例观察 1个月，基本治愈21例，占7.6%，显效119例，占42.8%，仅个别有轻微口干，极个别有轻微肝功能改变。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ffakxsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ffakxsu","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-dippkng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-dippkng","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经逢原》：狼毒大毒，非恒用之品。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-6acm02i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-6acm02i","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经》主咳逆上气，惟质实气壮暴咳者宜之。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-yv0h3t6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-yv0h3t6","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：狠毒杀鼠。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-5cj78g3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-5cj78g3","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《开宝本草》：别本注云：狼毒与麻黄、橘皮、吴茱萸、半夏、枳实为六陈也。狼毒，叶似商陆及大黄，茎叶上有毛，根皮黄、肉白。以实重者为良，轻者力劣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-1jqjs3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-1jqjs3g","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《纲目》：狼毒，出秦、晋地。今人往往以草茹为之，误矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-vy5de9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-vy5de9x","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本经》：主咳逆上气，破积聚，饮食，寒热，水气，恶疮，鼠瘘疽蚀，蛊毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-v4ucvmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-v4ucvmr","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《别录》：疗胁下积癖。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-vt5fjnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-vt5fjnj","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《药性论》：'治痰饮，症瘕。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-m55ixl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-m55ixl8","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《滇南本草》：治胃中年深日久饮食结住，积久稠痰，状粘如胶。攻虫积，利水道，下气，消水肿，吐痰涎。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-ygl6e2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-ygl6e2q","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草通玄》：主咳逆，治 虫疽，瘰疬，结痰，驱心痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-2wm3bg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-2wm3bg7","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《高原中草药治疗手册》：下气杀虫。治痰饮停留，骨膜发炎，结核顽疮，酒齄鼻。"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-zr2iyrr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-zr2iyrr","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240613104359-9y18cwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104359-9y18cwg","updated":"20240613104359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240613104401-me7vfa4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240613104401-me7vfa4"}},{"ID":"20240613104402-xo5k657","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240613104402-xo5k657"}}]}